---
layout: base.njk
title: Seb (the Canadian)
description: "Personal site for Seb Lathangue — civic technology, knowledge architecture, and the digital garden."
---
<div class="h-card">
  <header class="home-hero">
    {% set markClass = "home-hero__mark" %}{% include "mark.njk" %}
    <h1 class="home-hero__name p-name">Seb Lathangue</h1>
    <p class="home-hero__line">Translation is the job &mdash; getting complex systems and the people who use them to understand each&nbsp;other.</p>
    <p class="home-hero__meta">
      <span class="p-category">civic tech</span>
      <span class="identity__sep">·</span>
      <span class="p-category">knowledge architecture</span>
      <span class="identity__sep">·</span>
      <span class="p-locality">Toronto</span><span class="identity__sep">/</span><span class="p-region">ON</span>
    </p>
    <a class="u-url u-uid sr-only" href="{{ site.url }}" tabindex="-1">{{ site.url }}</a>
    <span class="p-country-name sr-only">Canada</span>
  </header>

  <p class="home-lede p-note">I work on knowledge architecture and data governance inside organizations &mdash; and run <a href="https://civcitdev.ca">CivCitDev</a>, a civic-technology program building tools like Ontario Tenant Tools. I treat governance less as rulemaking and more as a design problem: if the governed path is easier than the ungoverned one, people take it without being told to.</p>

  <hr class="home-rule" />

  {#- Order (2026-10-26): work first (case studies, then projects), then Now,
      then Elsewhere. The garden block came down 2026-10-27 while the
      writing is relaunched; see CHANGELOG. -#}

  <section class="home-block" aria-label="Projects">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Projects</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      {#- Case studies (pages tagged case-study) lead: they live on this site. -#}
      {%- for study in collections["case-study"] %}
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">study/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a href="{{ study.url }}">{{ study.data.title }}</a>
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta">practice piece</span>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
      {#- Work in progress told as an evolving native post (front matter: inProgress: true). -#}
      {%- for post in collections.writing %}
        {%- if post.data.inProgress %}
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">writing/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
          <span class="index-pill index-pill--active">in progress</span>
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta">evolving post</span>
      </div>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- for project in projects %}
        {%- if project.status == "active" and project.name != "Cognitive Architecture" and "cognitivearchitecture.ca" not in project.url %}
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">project/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.name }}</a>
          <span class="index-pill index-pill--active">active</span>
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta">{{ project.url | hostname }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></span>
      </div>
        {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="now" class="home-block home-now panel--alt" aria-label="Now">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Now</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Currently:</strong> {{ now.currently | safe }}
    </p>
    <p class="post-meta">
      <span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><time class="dt-updated" datetime="{{ now.updated }}">{{ now.updated | tendedState }}</time>
    </p>
  </section>

  {%- if collections.writingRecent.length %}
  <section class="home-block" aria-label="Writing">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Writing</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      {%- for post in collections.writingRecent %}
      {%- include "writing-row.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="home-more"><a href="/writing/">All writing &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <section class="home-block" aria-label="Elsewhere">
    <h2 class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</h2>
    <div class="index-table">
      <div class="index-row">
        <span class="index-row__label">contact/</span>
        <span class="index-row__desc">
          <a class="u-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          {%- for profile in profiles %} &middot; <a rel="me" href="{{ profile.url }}">{{ profile.platform | lower }}</a>{%- endfor %}
        </span>
        <span class="index-row__meta"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
